Sridevi Women’s Engineering College (SWEC) is a premier, private autonomous engineering college exclusively for women, located in Gandipet, Hyderabad, Telangana. Established in 2001 under the sponsorship of the Sridevi Education Society, the institution is dedicated to empowering women leaders in technology.
  The institute provides multi-level academic programs spanning UG and PG levels, with annual tuition fees typically ranging from ₹70,000 to ₹1,10,000+ depending on the specialization
    Affiliation & Approvals: The college is UGC Autonomous, approved by the AICTE, and affiliated with Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University, Hyderabad (JNTUH).
